  "description": "Executive 3-Bedroom Home in Ongar Park | Turn-Key Condition | 1-Year Initial Lease negotiable \nAddress: 8 Annaly Drive, Ongar Park, Dublin 15, D15 C7F1\nLease Term: 1 Year negotiable \nAvailability: Available Immediately\nFurnishing: Fully Furnished (Executive Finish) with beddings, towels and utilities. \n\nKey Features\nExecutive Turn-Key Finish: Meticulously furnished and equipped to a short-stay standard offering move-in-ready comfort. Cleaning and refresh services are also available if desirable. \n\nBright & Generous Accommodation: 3 well-appointed bedrooms including a spacious master bedroom with ensuite.\nOpen-Plan Living & Dining: Generously proportioned living area complemented by a modern kitchen and dining space with access to a private patio.\n\nAvailable Immediately –\n\nPresenting a contemporary 3-bedroom home situated in the highly desirable Ongar Park development in Dublin 15. Maintained to an exceptional, turn-key standard, this residence comes fully furnished with high-grade interior finishes, offering a seamless blend of luxury and everyday practical comfort.\n\nLiving Area: A bright and welcoming hallway opens into a cozy, interior-designed living room featuring warm solid flooring and elegant lighting.\n\nKitchen & Dining: An expansive open-plan kitchen and dining layout fitted with quality cabinetry and a full suite of modern integrated appliances (washer, oven, microwave). Sliding/patio doors lead out to the private rear space overlooking a common green area.\n\nBedrooms: Three spacious bedrooms featuring plush bedding and generous built-in storage/sliderobes. The master bedroom includes a sleek ensuite bathroom with bathtub and a power shower. Beddings, towels etc provided.\nBathrooms: Modern family bathroom tiled in porcelain with full power shower facilities.\n\nLocation & Amenities:\nSituated in the heart of Dublin 15, Ongar Park offers an ideal combination of community charm and urban convenience\n\nShopping & Lifestyle: A short walk to Ongar Village featuring Dunnes Stores, pharmacy, medical centre, bakeries, and local eateries. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is just a 7-minute drive away.\n\nTransport Links: Exceptional transit options with Hansfield and Clonsilla Train Stations nearby providing direct rail access to Dublin City Centre (Connolly Station / Docklands). Regular 39 & 39a bus routes service the immediate area.\n\nRoad Networks: Rapid access to the N3, M50 motorways, and Dublin Airport, making it ideal for commuters and based across North/West Greater Dublin.\n\nRental Terms & Application Instructions\nLease Duration: 12-Month Initial Lease negotiable. \nDeposit: Equivalent to 1 Month's Rent\nRequirements: References (Landlord & Employer), Proof of Identification, and Proof of Funds will be required prior to viewing confirmation.",
